IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `isa-separation`

-- Independence of Singapore Agreement 1965, Articles II, VII, VIII and Annex B ss 3, 6-14 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_independence-of-singapore-agreement-1965.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`a Singapore police inspector transferred to the federal police` MEANS Officer WITH
    `a Singapore government officer immediately before Malaysia Day` IS TRUE
    `became a Malaysian government officer on or after Malaysia Day` IS TRUE
    `engaged by Malaysia between Malaysia Day and Singapore Day` IS FALSE
    `in a department that was a Singapore State department before Malaysia Day` IS FALSE

`a Singapore High Court judge who became a federal judge` MEANS Officer WITH
    `a Singapore government officer immediately before Malaysia Day` IS TRUE
    `became a Malaysian government officer on or after Malaysia Day` IS TRUE
    `engaged by Malaysia between Malaysia Day and Singapore Day` IS FALSE
    `in a department that was a Singapore State department before Malaysia Day` IS FALSE

`a clerk hired by Malaysia in 1964 into a former Singapore State department` MEANS Officer WITH
    `a Singapore government officer immediately before Malaysia Day` IS FALSE
    `became a Malaysian government officer on or after Malaysia Day` IS FALSE
    `engaged by Malaysia between Malaysia Day and Singapore Day` IS TRUE
    `in a department that was a Singapore State department before Malaysia Day` IS TRUE

`a clerk hired by Malaysia in 1964 into a federal ministry` MEANS Officer WITH
    `a Singapore government officer immediately before Malaysia Day` IS FALSE
    `became a Malaysian government officer on or after Malaysia Day` IS FALSE
    `engaged by Malaysia between Malaysia Day and Singapore Day` IS TRUE
    `in a department that was a Singapore State department before Malaysia Day` IS FALSE

`a Singapore officer who stayed with the State Government` MEANS Officer WITH
    `a Singapore government officer immediately before Malaysia Day` IS TRUE
    `became a Malaysian government officer on or after Malaysia Day` IS FALSE
    `engaged by Malaysia between Malaysia Day and Singapore Day` IS FALSE
    `in a department that was a Singapore State department before Malaysia Day` IS FALSE

`a federal officer from Kuala Lumpur` MEANS Officer WITH
    `a Singapore government officer immediately before Malaysia Day` IS FALSE
    `became a Malaysian government officer on or after Malaysia Day` IS TRUE
    `engaged by Malaysia between Malaysia Day and Singapore Day` IS FALSE
    `in a department that was a Singapore State department before Malaysia Day` IS FALSE

